MOBS licensing

MOBS is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (see LICENSE). This follows the project's
own decision: OBS Studio is GPLv2, Monologue is MIT, and the combined work is GPLv2 (docs/adr/0002 and 0006).

This repository contains three things, each in its own directory:

  obs/        OBS Studio, imported with its full history as a git subtree. GPLv2. Its own COPYING is kept.
  monologue/  Monologue, imported with its full history as a git subtree. MIT. Its own licence file is kept.
  mobs/       The MOBS application, which links libobs and so is GPLv2.

The imported directories are not modified here, and their commits keep their original hashes so that
upstream updates can still be pulled in. Their authors and licences are their own.
